@kind(writ)

#[ Writ: pure-dep-source fixture ]

##[ parser-purity ]

@rule(parser-purity){
  guard: { twrit: pure }

  pure: {
    crates: [ "core" ]
    forbid: [ "std::fs" ]
    allow-external: [ ]
  }
}

`inner` is a workspace member, so the allowlist half walks through it
into its dependencies. The `forbid` half stops at `core/src/`, so the
same crate is trusted by one check and unexamined by the other.
